Vendor MT7916 firmware/config for the npu branch.

These files are not stored in this repository. apply.sh copies them from
E2631_VENDOR_FW_DIR (default: $E2631_WORK/out/stock-fw) into this directory
at build time:

  WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7916.bin
  7916_WACPU_RAM_CODE_release.bin
  mt7916_patch_e1_hdr.bin
  MT7916_EEPROM.bin
  l1profile.dat.dbdc
  mt7916.dbdc.b0.dat
  mt7916.dbdc.b1.dat

They are the vendor blobs already pulled from the live router for the
vendor-native CSP_WLAN work. Keep the source directory out of git; the build
warns and continues with a missing-firmware image when it is absent.
